future-pkg: coach decision support prototype

Third-party knowledge sources (referenced by identifier; see docs/alignment.md):

- Uberon multi-species anatomy ontology, CC BY 3.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). http://uberon.org
- Wikidata item identifiers and labels for equipment, CC0. https://www.wikidata.org
- SNOMED CT: identifiers only, no SNOMED content is distributed. See README.
  The NCI EVS REST API is used only in tests to check that those identifiers
  resolve; no NCI Thesaurus content is used or distributed.

The SKOS export (kg/export/coachkg-skos.ttl) states the same in dcterms:rights.

Fonts bundled in the web app:

- IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono (via @fontsource), Copyright IBM Corp.,
  SIL Open Font License 1.1. The licence text ships with the site in
  /third-party-notices.txt, together with the notices of every other bundled
  open-source package (generated at build; see LICENSES.md for all dependencies).

Input data (data/exercises.json, data/member-context.json) is fetched at build
time from github.com/future-research/candidate-assessment and is not
redistributed in this repository.
